  "verseCount": 23,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "8",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ZEC 8"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "8",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Onyenwe anyị",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ekwe nkwa ịgọzi Jerusalem",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 8:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okwu",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Onyenwe anyị",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ZEC.8.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ZEC.8.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", Onye pụrụ ime ihe niile ruru m ntị na-asị,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ihe ndị a ka",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Onyenwe anyị",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ZEC.8.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ZEC.8.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", Onye pụrụ ime ihe niile kwuru: \"Ana m ekwo ekworo dị ukwuu nʼihi Zayọn. Nʼezie, ekworo ahụ na-anụ m ọkụ dị ukwuu nʼahụ.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ihe ndị a ka",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Onyenwe anyị",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ZEC.8.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ZEC.8.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kwuru, \"Aga m alọghachi na Zayọn, bịa biri na Jerusalem. Mgbe ahụ, a ga-akpọ Jerusalem, obodo Eziokwu. A ga-akpọkwa ugwu",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Onyenwe anyị",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ZEC.8.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ZEC.8.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", Onye pụrụ ime ihe niile Ugwu Nsọ.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ihe ndị a ka",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Onyenwe anyị",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ZEC.8.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ZEC.8.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", Onye pụrụ ime ihe niile kwuru, \"Agadi ndị ikom na agadi ndị inyom ga-anọdụkwa ala ọzọ na mbara ụzọ niile nke Jerusalem, onye ọbụla ga-ejidekwa mkpara nʼaka ya",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "nʼihi ọnụọgụgụ afọ ha gbara.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okporoụzọ nke obodo ahụ niile ga-ejupụtakwa nʼụmụntakịrị ndị nwoke na ndị nwanyị na-egwugharị egwu na ama ebe ahụ.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ihe ndị a ka",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Onyenwe anyị",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ZEC.8.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ZEC.8.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", Onye pụrụ ime ihe niile kwuru, \"O nwere ike bụrụ na ihe ndị a ga-adị ka ihe dịkarịrị ike imezu nʼanya ndị ahụ ga-afọdụ nʼoge ahụ, ma ọ ga-abụ ihe dịkarịrị ike ime nʼanya m?\" Otu a ka",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Onyenwe anyị",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ZEC.8.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ZEC.8.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", Onye pụrụ ime ihe niile kwubiri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ihe ndị a ka",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Onyenwe anyị",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ZEC.8.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ZEC.8.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", Onye pụrụ ime ihe niile kwuru, \"Aga m azọpụta ndị m site na mba niile dị nʼọwụwa anyanwụ na nʼọdịda anyanwụ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aga m akpọghachitekwa ha, mee ka ha biri na Jerusalem. Ha ga-abụkwa ndị m, mụ onwe m ga-abụ Chineke ha, onye ezi omume na onye kwesiri ntụkwasị obi.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ihe ndị a ka",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Onyenwe anyị",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ZEC.8.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ZEC.8.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", Onye pụrụ ime ihe niile kwuru: \"Ka aka unu sie ike,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "ka enwe ike wuo ụlọnsọ a, unu ndị na-anụ ugbu a otu okwu ahụ, nke ndị amụma kwuru mgbe a tọrọ ntọala iwugharị ụlọnsọ m, bụ ụlọ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Onyenwe anyị",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ZEC.8.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ZEC.8.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", Onye pụrụ ime ihe niile.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tupu ụbọchị ahụ, akwụbeghị ma ndị mmadụ ma ụmụ anụmanụ ụgwọ ọrụ ha. Ọ dịghịkwa udo dịrị onye ọbụla na-apụ apụ maọbụ onye na-abata abata nʼihi ndị iro ya, ebe m mere ka onye ọbụla bụrụ onye na-emegide ibe ya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ma ugbu a, agaghị m emeso ndị fọdụrụ nʼala a, dịka m si meso ha nʼoge gara aga.\" Otu a ka",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Onyenwe anyị",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ZEC.8.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ZEC.8.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", Onye pụrụ ime ihe niile kwupụtara.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Nʼihi na mkpụrụ ga-eto nke ọma, osisi vaịnị ga-amị mkpụrụ ya, ala ubi ga-ewepụtakwa ihe omume, igirigi eluigwe ga-ezokwasịkwa ala. Ihe ndị a niile ka m ga-enye ndị fọdụrụ nʼala a ka ọ bụụrụ ha ihe nketa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dịka unu bụ Juda na Izrel si bụrụ ihe a na-abụ ọnụ nʼetiti mba dị iche iche, otu a ka m ga-esi zọpụta unu, unu ga-abụkwa ngọzị. Unu atụla ụjọ, kama meenụ ka aka unu sie ike nʼọrụ unu.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 8:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ihe ndị a ka",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Onyenwe anyị",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ZEC.8.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ZEC.8.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", Onye pụrụ ime ihe niile kwuru, \"Dịka m si kpebie ime ka ihe ọjọọ bịakwasị unu, na dịka m na-egosighị ebere nʼahụ nna nna unu ha mgbe ha kpasuru m iwe,\" ka",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Onyenwe anyị",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ZEC.8.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ZEC.8.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", Onye pụrụ ime ihe niile na-ekwu,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 8:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"otu a ka m kpebikwara ọzọ nʼụbọchị ndị a imere Jerusalem na Juda ihe ọma. Unu atụla ụjọ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 8:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ihe ndị a ka unu ga-eme: Kwuonụ eziokwu nye ibe unu, kpeenụ ikpe eziokwu nʼụlọikpe unu, nke a na-eweta udo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 8:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Unu echela echiche ọjọọ megide ibe unu; unu ahụla ịṅụ iyi ụgha nʼanya. Ihe ndị a niile ka m kpọrọ asị,\" otu a ka",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Onyenwe anyị",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ZEC.8.17",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ZEC.8.17"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kwubiri ya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
